---
import MainLayout from "../layouts/MainLayout.astro";
import Header from "../components/Header.astro";
import Hero from "../components/Hero.astro";
---

<MainLayout>

<div id="top"></div>

<Header />

<main id="main-content">
<Hero />

<section class="impact" id="impact" aria-labelledby="impact-title">

<div class="section-heading">
<span class="eyebrow">DELIVERY IMPACT</span>
<h2 id="impact-title">Enterprise delivery at a glance</h2>
<p>Experience, leadership and operating expertise focused on measurable transformation.</p>
</div>

<div class="metrics">

<div class="metric-card">
<h2>17+</h2>
<p>Years Experience</p>
</div>

<div class="metric-card">
<h2>Staff</h2>
<p>Program Manager</p>
</div>

<div class="metric-card">
<h2>CloudOps</h2>
<p>DevOps • AI</p>
</div>

<div class="metric-card">
<h2>Enterprise</h2>
<p>Transformation</p>
</div>

</div>

</section>

<section class="about" id="about" aria-labelledby="about-title">
  <div class="about-intro">
    <span class="eyebrow">WHAT I DELIVER</span>
    <h2 id="about-title">Strategy translated into operating results</h2>
    <p>
      I connect executive priorities, engineering execution and operational data
      to create delivery systems that leaders can trust and teams can sustain.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="capability-grid">
    <article class="capability-card">
      <span class="capability-number">01</span>
      <h3>Enterprise Program Leadership</h3>
      <p>Portfolio governance, dependency management and decision-ready reporting across complex programs.</p>
    </article>
    <article class="capability-card">
      <span class="capability-number">02</span>
      <h3>Cloud &amp; DevOps Operations</h3>
      <p>Reliable operating models spanning CloudOps, DevOps, SRE practices, releases and service performance.</p>
    </article>
    <article class="capability-card">
      <span class="capability-number">03</span>
      <h3>Agile Delivery Governance</h3>
      <p>Practical sprint controls, Jira governance and measurable flow improvements without process overhead.</p>
    </article>
    <article class="capability-card">
      <span class="capability-number">04</span>
      <h3>AI-Enabled Operations</h3>
      <p>Human-centered automation, intelligent reporting and agentic workflows built for adoption and auditability.</p>
    </article>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="stories" id="success-stories" aria-labelledby="stories-title">
  <div class="section-heading stories-heading">
    <span class="eyebrow">PROVEN OUTCOMES</span>
    <h2 id="stories-title">Transformation made measurable</h2>
    <p>Selected examples of turning complex operational challenges into governed, visible and sustainable outcomes.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="story-grid">
    <article class="story-card story-featured">
      <div class="story-meta"><span>Operational Excellence</span><strong>+22%</strong></div>
      <h3>Improved service-level adherence across cloud operations</h3>
      <p>Standardized SLA governance, ownership signals and executive reporting to focus teams on resolution health and aging work.</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Unified incident and service-request visibility</li>
        <li>Automated amber and breach monitoring</li>
        <li>Decision-ready weekly leadership reporting</li>
      </ul>
    </article>

    <article class="story-card">
      <div class="story-meta"><span>Delivery Governance</span><strong>5 teams</strong></div>
      <h3>Created one operating rhythm across distributed teams</h3>
      <p>Connected sprint controls, dependencies, release readiness and stakeholder reporting in a shared governance model.</p>
    </article>

    <article class="story-card">
      <div class="story-meta"><span>Intelligent Operations</span><strong>AI</strong></div>
      <h3>Reduced manual reporting through governed automation</h3>
      <p>Designed automated executive summaries and context-aware nudges with clear auditability and human ownership.</p>
    </article>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="frameworks" id="frameworks" aria-labelledby="frameworks-title">
  <div class="section-heading">
    <span class="eyebrow">PRACTICAL FRAMEWORKS</span>
    <h2 id="frameworks-title">Governance that accelerates delivery</h2>
    <p>Reusable operating models designed to create clarity, accountability and measurable flow.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="framework-grid">
    <article class="framework-card"><span>01</span><h3>Delivery Control System</h3><p>Connect strategy, sprint commitments, dependencies, risks and outcomes in one decision rhythm.</p></article>
    <article class="framework-card"><span>02</span><h3>Cloud Operations Health</h3><p>Turn service levels, aging work, cost signals and incident trends into action-ready operational control.</p></article>
    <article class="framework-card"><span>03</span><h3>Responsible AI Adoption</h3><p>Move from isolated experiments to governed automation with human ownership, auditability and value measures.</p></article>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="articles" id="articles" aria-labelledby="articles-title">
  <div class="articles-intro">
    <span class="eyebrow">FIELD NOTES</span>
    <h2 id="articles-title">Ideas for better enterprise delivery</h2>
    <p>Concise perspectives drawn from operating complex programs, platforms and transformation initiatives.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="article-list">
    <article><span>Agile Governance</span><h3>Measure sprint confidence, not activity</h3><p>A practical shift from output reporting to commitment reliability, scope stability and decision quality.</p></article>
    <article><span>Operations</span><h3>Make executive reporting operational</h3><p>Build reports that expose the next decision, accountable owner and delivery consequence.</p></article>
    <article><span>AI Adoption</span><h3>Automation earns trust through evidence</h3><p>Design agentic workflows with visible controls, clear escalation and measurable human outcomes.</p></article>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="contact" id="contact" aria-labelledby="contact-title">
  <div>
    <span class="eyebrow">LET'S CONNECT</span>
    <h2 id="contact-title">Turn complex delivery into clear outcomes</h2>
    <p>For enterprise program leadership, operating-model transformation and delivery governance conversations.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="contact-actions">
    <a class="primary" href="mailto:nagulapalli.kranthi@gmail.com?subject=Enterprise%20Agile%20Conversation">Email Kranthi</a>
    <a class="secondary" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/kranthi-n" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Connect on LinkedIn</a>
  </div>
</section>
</main>

<footer class="site-footer">
  <a class="footer-brand" href="#top">Enterprise Agile</a>
  <p>Enterprise program leadership, operational excellence and responsible AI adoption.</p>
  <div class="footer-links" aria-label="Footer navigation">
    <a href="#about">About</a>
    <a href="#success-stories">Success Stories</a>
    <a href="/models/executive-portfolio/">UI Models</a>
    <a href="#contact">Contact</a>
    <a href="/downloads/Kranthi-Kumar-Nagulapally-Resume.pdf" download>Resume</a>
  </div>
  <p class="footer-meta">© {new Date().getFullYear()} Kranthi Kumar Nagulapally</p>
</footer>

<!-- release: 0.3.0 -->
</MainLayout>
